    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yuda o Tamar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nena olong'i, etadoyie Yuda alo aing'uaa ilalashera nelo aitaa elatia oltung'ani obo le Adullam oji enkarna enye Hira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore etii ine nedol Yuda entito e likae tung'ani loo Lkanaan neji enkarna enye Shua; neyam ninye nelo aboitare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiroshiu neiu enkayioni, nedung'oki ninye enkarna ajo Eri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ake anutayu neiu enkayioni, nedungoki ninye enkarna enye ajo Onan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ake aigil aiu enkayioni, neisho ng'otonye enkarna enye ajo Shela. Naa Kesib apa etii peyie eiu Shela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyamaki Yuda olayioni lenye kikau Eri enkitok, naji enkarna enye Tamar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore apa ilo kikau lenye oji Eri, naa oltung'ani apa arruoni oleng te dukuya Olaitoriani; near Olaitoriani ninye metua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina peyie ejoki Yuda Onan, “Shomo tijing'aki ina kitok oliai o lalashe lino tayiolo ninye, pee etum olalashe lino nkera te iyie.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eyiolo Onan ajo ore inkera naaiu nemeaku inenyena, neaku ore ake peyie elo ayiolou enkitok olalashe lenye, nebukoki enkare e le waisho enkop pee meisho ake inkera olalashe lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ina nataasa, eitu katukul eitiship Olaitoriani, near sii ninye metua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina peyie ejoki Yuda Tamar ina kitok o layioni lenye. “Totona ira enkoliai te nkaji e papaai lino, o metaba anaa nebulu olayioni lai Shela.” Amu etureishe ajo keidim sii ninye atua anaa ilalashera lenyena. Metaa eshomo Tamar enkaji e menye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore etulusoyie enkiti rishata neye enkitok e Yuda, entito e Shua. Ore peyie eitagoli Yuda, nelo ninye tenebo olchore lenye Hira le Adulam ewueji neji Timna, ewueji negirae aabarnie intare enyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie elikini Tamar aajoki, “Ekeloito olaputani lino Timna abarn intare enyena.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitayu to sesen lenye inkilani enyena e nkoliai, nepika enkarasha aitoipie elukunya enye peyie medoli enkomom, nelotu aton te kishomi e Enaim, natii enkoitoi nalala nalo Timna; amu etodua ajo etubulua Shela, neitu eishori ninye meyama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie edol Yuda ninye, nedamu ninye ejo inoshi kituaak naibor onyek, amu eitoipo ninye enkomom enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelo ninye enetii te mbata enkoitoi nalala nejoki ninye, “Wou inchooki maatayiolo,” amu eitu eyiolou ninye ajo entito olayioni lenye. Nejo ninye, “Ainyoo naa kincho peyie kitum atayiolo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newal ajo, “Ekaairriwaki olkuoo too ntare aainei.” Nejo Tamar, “Amaa aikincho entoki ino naibung naarreshunye o terewakaki ilo kuo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo, “Ainyoo iyieu naaisho?” Newal ajo, “Inchooki olgisoi lino o enkeene ino, o ina ng'udi ino nimbung'ita te nkaina ino.” Neaku eishooyie ninye ninche nelo ayiolou ninye neiroshiu ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neinyototo alo; neitayu enkarasha te nkomom neishop inkilani enyena e nkolia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie eirriu Yuda olkuoo eyau olchore lenye le Adullam, peyie etum enaduoo kitok aishoru intokitin naata e Yuda nelotu alau ninye te naduoo wueji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neikilikuan ninye iltung'ana ootii ine ajoki, “Koree ake enkitok mulayoi natii naaji embata enkoitoi nalala e Naim aton?” Nejo ninche, “Meetae emulayoi natii ene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku etushukokine Yuda nejoki, “Eitu alo atum, netejo sii iltung'ana le ine, ‘Metii emulayoi natii ine.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newal Yuda ajo, “Inchoo ninye eya nena tokitin aitaa inenyena, peyie mekueniyieki ake iyiook; idol ajo airriwaka ele kuo, neitu ilo ainepu ninye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie eishunye ilapaitin okuni, nelikini Yuda aajoki, “Ore Tamar enkitok o layioni lino, etaa emulayoi, ore ake sii eiroishi te nkerai e mulayaisho.” Nejo Yuda, “Entoriku entupuku boo peyie kipuo aapejoo ninye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eitupukuni boo, neirriwaa olkilikuai airriwaki olaputani lenye ejo, “Olopeny kuna tokitin anotie enkerai.” Nejo, “Ing'ura tujurru, aatasayia, ainkuneng'ae, kuna tokitin o lgisoi, o enkeene, o eng'udi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenyorraa Yuda ninche nejo, “Aisinyati ninye peyie aalang, anaa keitu apa aitabaya ororei lai aisho ninye olayioni lai Shela meyama.” Neitu eitoki aikata ayiolou ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie ebau enkata najing aji neiu ilmao te ishoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore earita enkop, neitayu obo enkaina aitupuku neng'amaa enkaitoiyioni neeniki ina aina enkopito pile, ejoito, “Ele otang'asunye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore erriny enkaina enye, ng'ura, nepuku olalashe, nejo enkaitoiyioni, “Metaa inji doi inkununye tinipuku!” Nedungokini ninye enkarna enye aajo Peres. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi nepuku olalashe lenye eeta enaduoo opito pile eenikino enkaina enye; neipoti enkarna enye aajo Serah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
